Here is the percentage of realized revenue for each artist, including artist ID, artist name, revenue, and revenue percentage.

Executed SQL:
SELECT a.artist_id, a.name AS artist_name, SUM(ii.unit_price * ii.quantity) AS revenue, (SUM(ii.unit_price * ii.quantity) / (SELECT SUM(ii2.unit_price * ii2.quantity) FROM invoice_items ii2 INNER JOIN invoices i2 ON ii2.invoice_id = i2.invoice_id)) * 100 AS revenue_percentage FROM artists a INNER JOIN albums al ON a.artist_id = al.artist_id INNER JOIN tracks t ON al.album_id = t.album_id INNER JOIN invoice_items ii ON t.track_id = ii.track_id INNER JOIN invoices i ON ii.invoice_id = i.invoice_id GROUP BY a.artist_id, a.name ORDER BY revenue DESC;

